{"availability":"available","full":"zqc3117/Spotter","name":"Spotter","description":"Official codebase for Spotter: Let the Embodied Model Lead, and the VLM Reflect for It","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":165,"forks":21,"created":"2026-09-29T04:58:07Z","updated":"2026-10-05T09:27:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://zqc3117.github.io/Spotter/","topics":[],"demo":"https://zqc3117.github.io/Spotter/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.677Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.677Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.677Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.677Z","stars":165,"forks":21}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["If our project helps you, please give us a star ⭐ on GitHub to support us.","Spotter adds a lightweight intervention layer between a frozen embodied model (System 1) and a VLM (System 2). Instead of having the VLM plan every step, the embodied model leads and keeps executing, while a local screener watches in parallel and the VLM steps in only to confirm and repair an error. The VLM's job becomes much simpler, so the whole framework works with a locally served, open-source Qwen and no privileged information.","Existing VLM-led robot agents are serial: the VLM plans a segment, the embodied model executes it, and the VLM decides what comes next. This forces a dilemma:"],"features":["A lightweight intervention layer. Like a person who keeps a little attention on a task and focuses only when","something looks wrong, Spotter lets execution flow continuously and brings in the VLM only on a confirmed error.","A simpler job for the VLM. The VLM no longer drives the robot. It only has to notice a failure, repair it with","a short primitive plan, and check the fix. A local Qwen with no access to the task's success signal is enough.","Continuous execution, low overhead. The embodied model never waits for the VLM on the routine path:"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zqc3117/Spotter/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"639f43effbe68be31d8149441f0dc65d193fd00d6215f0ba74da181d374b26fc","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.772Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.772Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"If our project helps you, please give us a star ⭐ on GitHub to support us.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zqc3117/Spotter/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"639f43effbe68be31d8149441f0dc65d193fd00d6215f0ba74da181d374b26fc","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zqc3117/Spotter/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.772Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T09:27:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zqc3117/Spotter/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.773Z","hash":"639f43effbe68be31d8149441f0dc65d193fd00d6215f0ba74da181d374b26fc","originalBytes":24839,"storedBytes":24839,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["policy","robotwin","judge","bash","qwen","spotter","episode","run","robocasa","spotter.sh","model","only","cosmos","env","vlm","runs","bank","embodied","episodes","explore","pi05","recovery","step","per","screener","one","screen","same","window","assets","budget","seed","arm","chunks","example","own","python","rpc","server","service","simulation","task","calls","control","default","driver","engine","every","gpu","keep","license","local","max","paper","pi0.5","port","repair","sets","turns","vllm","api","check","env.sh","evaluation","family","install","interventions","lane","memory","privileged","set","setup","smoke","steps","success","after","async","ctrl","each","environment","fewshot","file","information","intervention","lanes","lessons","library","needs","one-shot","outputs","party","released","shot","supervision","tel","third","windows","before","brief","checkpoints","compact","execution","full","gpt","gpus","never","notices.md","once","pip","reset","results.jsonl","